              <th>EDT (UTC-4)<br/><a href="/ist-to-est/">IST to EDT</a></th>
              <th>PST (UTC-8)<br/><a href="/gmt-to-pst/">IST to PST</a></th>
              <th>CET (UTC+1)<br/><a href="/cet-to-est/">IST to CET</a></th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td>00:00 IST (Midnight)</td>
              <td>18:30 (Prev Day)</td>
              <td>13:30 (Prev Day)</td>
              <td>14:30 (Prev Day)</td>
              <td>10:30 (Prev Day)</td>
              <td>19:30 (Prev Day)</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
